{"id":"4cbfb5925afe7f86","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set.md","title":"ZFC Logic9 Admissible Set","display":"df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set — ZFC Logic9 Admissible Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set"],"display":"df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set — ZFC Logic9 Admissible Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch17/58-df-logic.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","[[58-df-transitive]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]","[[58-df-kripke-platek.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set — ZFC Logic9 Admissible Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"44e32f3fb4334e0c\" href=\"?note=44e32f3fb4334e0c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-logic.md\">../batch17/58-df-logic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" href=\"?note=2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" title=\"58-df-transitive\">58-df-transitive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8d1853eb0947b911\" href=\"?note=8d1853eb0947b911\" title=\"58-df-kripke-platek.md\">58-df-kripke-platek.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> (set parameter)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Transitive}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Transitive}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (transitive-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" href=\"?note=2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" title=\"58-df-transitive\">58-df-transitive</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KP}\\in V\">\\(\\operatorname{KP}\\in V\\)</span> (the Kripke--Platek theory as a set of membership-language sentences)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,A)\\)</span> (canonical set-coded membership structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathfrak A,\\operatorname{KP})\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathfrak A,\\operatorname{KP})\\)</span> (model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KP}\">\\(\\operatorname{KP}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\{\\in\\}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\{\\in\\}}\\)</span> 及无穷公理的取舍固定为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"8d1853eb0947b911\" href=\"?note=8d1853eb0947b911\" title=\"58-df-kripke-platek\">58-df-kripke-platek</a> 中的显式编码；不再把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KP}\">\\(\\operatorname{KP}\\)</span> 当作可自由选择的理论参数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}admissible\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Transitive}(A)\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,A)\\land\n\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathfrak A,\\operatorname{KP})\n\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}admissible\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Transitive}(A)\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,A)\\land\n\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathfrak A,\\operatorname{KP})\n\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The membership structure and its satisfaction recursion are selected explicitly; the bare expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,\\in)\\models\\operatorname{KP}\">\\((A,\\in)\\models\\operatorname{KP}\\)</span> did not denote the registered four-place satisfaction relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"",